                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q10</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">Sort "admin-owns vs dev-owns": etcd backup · a Deployment · RBAC · a ConfigMap · a node upgrade.</div>
                    <details>
                        <summary>Show Answer</summary>
                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>🔧 CKA admin owns</th><th>👩‍💻 CKAD dev owns</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr><td>etcd backup</td><td>a Deployment</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>RBAC</td><td>a ConfigMap</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>a node upgrade</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <div class="eq-explanation">
                            <div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div>
                            <p>RBAC is borderline — devs may <em>request</em> roles, but defining and granting cluster access is an admin responsibility. The rule of thumb: if it's <em>below the app</em>, it's CKA.</p>
