                            <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">static pod — create &amp; delete (on the node)</span></div>
<pre><code class="language-bash"><span class="comment"># create: drop a manifest where the kubelet watches</span>
sudo vi /etc/kubernetes/manifests/static-easypj.yaml   <span class="comment"># path = staticPodPath in /var/lib/kubelet/config.yaml</span>
<span class="comment"># delete: remove the FILE — `kubectl delete` just gets recreated</span>
sudo rm /etc/kubernetes/manifests/static-easypj.yaml</code></pre>
