                <h4>"Framework," "Platform," and "Product" — Three Words People Use Loosely</h4>
                <p>These three words get used almost interchangeably in casual conversation, but they describe genuinely different levels of finished-ness — and knowing which one Backstage is prevents the "why do we still have work to do after installing it?" surprise:</p>
