                            <tr><td><strong>Platform</strong></td><td>A managed service you configure, not code against</td><td>A hosted SaaS ITSM tool</td><td>❌ No</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>Framework</strong></td><td>A set of building blocks you assemble &amp; extend into your own thing</td><td>Django, React</td><td>✅ Yes</td></tr>
