                <h3 class="section-h">1.7 The CNCF and Backstage</h3>
                <p>Backstage isn't just "Spotify's open-source project" — since 2020 it has been governed by the <strong>Cloud Native Computing Foundation (CNCF)</strong>, the same neutral home that hosts Kubernetes, Prometheus, and Envoy. Knowing exactly <em>where</em> it sits in the CNCF's maturity ladder is one of the most literally-tested facts on the CBA exam.</p>

