                <p>Read it bottom-up: every <code>Entity</code> has a <code>Kind</code> (Component, API, Resource…); related entities group into a <code>System</code>; related Systems group into a <code>Domain</code>; and a <code>Group</code> — a team — owns entities at any level. That's the entire nesting model in one picture, and it's exactly the shape §1.12 builds out for jobpost.</p>
