                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q3</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">Is Backstage a CNCF Graduated project? Justify your answer with the specific criterion it hasn't cleared.</div>
                    <details>
                        <summary>Show Answer</summary>
                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <p>No. Backstage is <strong>CNCF Incubating</strong> (since March 2022). Graduated requires a passed third-party security audit plus 2+ years of proven production use across multiple, unrelated companies — Backstage hasn't cleared that full bar yet, even though it has real, growing multi-company adoption.</p>
