                                                                (K8s, Prometheus…)
                        </pre>
                        <div class="eq-explanation">
                            <div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div>
                            <p>"Widely adopted" and "Graduated" are not the same claim — Kubernetes, Prometheus, Envoy, Helm, Argo, and Cilium are the CNCF Graduated tier; Backstage sits one rung below, at Incubating.</p>
