                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <p>"An Entity is a <strong>THING</strong>, a Kind is its <strong>TYPE</strong>, and an Annotation is a <strong>STICKY NOTE</strong> that tells a Plugin where to find more info about it."</p>
