                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <div class="eq-explanation">
                            <div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div>
                            <p>This single sentence (§1.9) is deliberately memorable because it unlocks nearly every later vocabulary term — Component and Resource are just specific Kinds; every plugin card you'll ever configure reads an Annotation to know where to look.</p>
