                        <pre class="uth-diagram">
   🖥️ Backstage hosted on:  AWS ECS  (no K8s here at all)
   🔌 K8s plugin reads:     a DIFFERENT team's ☸️ cluster  ──▶  pod-health card ✅
                        </pre>
