            <section class="section-block" id="b-s2-1">
                <h3 class="section-h">2.1 The Three-Layer Architecture</h3>
                <p>Every single feature in this guide — the Catalog, Templates, TechDocs, Plugins — is built from the exact same 3 layers. Learn this stack once and every later architecture diagram is just "which of these 3 boxes does this live in?"</p>

                <div class="arch-layers">
                    <div class="arch-layer layer-app">
                        <span class="layer-icon">🖥️</span>
                        <span class="layer-name">Frontend</span>
                        <span class="layer-desc">React + TypeScript + Material UI — what users see</span>
                        <div class="layer-examples"><span>Plugin UI components</span><span>Catalog browser</span><span>Template wizard</span><span>TechDocs reader</span><span>Dashboard cards</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="arch-layer layer-k8s">
                        <span class="layer-icon">⚙️</span>
                        <span class="layer-name">Backend</span>
                        <span class="layer-desc">Node.js + Express — business logic, talks to the database</span>
                        <div class="layer-examples"><span>Plugin backend services</span><span>Catalog ingestion</span><span>Scaffolder engine</span><span>Search index</span><span>Auth &amp; permissions</span><span>TechDocs pipeline</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="arch-layer layer-infra">
                        <span class="layer-icon">💾</span>
                        <span class="layer-name">Database</span>
                        <span class="layer-desc">PostgreSQL (production) or SQLite (dev) — persistent storage</span>
                        <div class="layer-examples"><span>Catalog entities</span><span>User preferences</span><span>Template execution history</span><span>Plugin state</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="diagram-container">
                    <div class="diagram-title">The 3-Layer Stack, With Its Own Connections Labeled</div>
