                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q10</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">A junior dev finishes writing a brand-new backend plugin — it compiles cleanly, and other plugins' routes all work fine — but every request to the new plugin's own routes returns a flat 404. What's the most likely cause?</div>
