            <div class="cka-practice-drill">
                <h4>🔬 Practice Drill 3.3 — Write jobpost's catalog-info.yaml from Memory</h4>
                <div class="drill-timer">⏱️ Target Time: 6 minutes</div>
                <div class="drill-scenario">
                    <h5>Scenario</h5>
                    <p>Without looking back at §3.5, write jobpost's full Component entry from memory — <code>apiVersion</code>, <code>kind</code>, <code>metadata</code> (name, one annotation, one label), and <code>spec</code> (type, lifecycle, owner). Then check it against §3.5's real version.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="drill-hint">
                    <strong>Hint:</strong> jobpost's GitHub annotation, techdocs annotation, and owner are all values you've now seen repeated across this whole chapter.
                </div>
                <div class="drill-solution">
                    <details>
