                    <li><strong>Keep the §5.2 "which section do I edit?" table open while configuring</strong> — it's faster than searching docs.</li>
                    <li><strong>Grep <code>app-config*.yaml</code> for a key</strong> before assuming which file currently sets it (§5.4).</li>
