            <span class="ch-jump" id="b-ch5-commands"></span>
            <h3 class="section-h">🔑 Commands to Know (Chapter 5)</h3>
            <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">daily CLI cheat card</span></div>
