            <section class="section-block" id="b-s7-1">
                <h3 class="section-h">7.1 What is the Software Catalog?</h3>
                <p>The Software Catalog is Backstage's <strong>central registry</strong> of everything in your engineering ecosystem. Think of it as the "phone book" for your software — it knows every service, who owns it, what APIs it provides, what it depends on, and where its documentation lives. Best part? It auto-discovers and auto-updates — no manual data entry required.</p>

                <div class="diagram-container">
                    <div class="diagram-title">The Catalog — Your Software Nervous System</div>
<pre>
