            <span class="ch-jump" id="b-ch8-lab"></span>
            <div class="cka-exam-questions lab">
                <h4>🧠 Chapter 8 — Lab Q&amp;A · Concept Check (10)</h4>
                <p class="section-lead">Quick recall of entity kinds, relationships, and YAML structure — 10 questions, each with a full answer &amp; explanation.</p>

                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q1</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">What are the 7 main entity kinds in Backstage, and give an example of each for easypj?</div>
                    <details><summary>Show Answer</summary>
                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Kind</th><th>easypj example</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr><td>Component</td><td>jobpost (Django service)</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>API</td><td>jobpost-api (OpenAPI REST API)</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>System</td><td>easypj-system (groups components)</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>Domain</td><td>hr-domain (business area)</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>Resource</td><td>postgres-db (database)</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>User</td><td>jane.doe (person)</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>Group</td><td>team-platform (team)</td></tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>There's also Template (8th kind) and Location (9th kind). The CBA focuses on the 7 main kinds — knowing which one to use for any given scenario is critical.</p></div>
