                    <li><strong>Clusters are configured under <code>kubernetes.clusterLocatorMethods</code></strong> — config, catalog, gke or localKubectlProxy.</li>
                    <li><strong><code>kubernetes-id</code> matches by exact name;</strong> <code>kubernetes-label-selector</code> matches when one entity maps to multiple K8s objects sharing a label.</li>
