                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>Each cluster needs: name, url, authProvider, and the token. Never hardcode the token — always use <code>${K8S_SA_TOKEN}</code>.</p></div>
                    </details>
                </div>

                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q6</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">You deployed jobpost to K8s but the entity page shows no K8s tab. What are 3 things to check?</div>
