                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q8</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">What K8s RBAC permissions does Backstage need to view resources?</div>
                    <details><summary>Show Answer</summary>
                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <p>At minimum: <code>get</code>, <code>list</code>, and <code>watch</code> on Deployments, Pods, Services, Ingresses, and ReplicaSets — read-only, never <code>create</code>/<code>update</code>/<code>delete</code>.</p>
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Verbs</th><th>Resources</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr><td>get, list, watch</td><td>Pods, Services, Deployments, ReplicaSets, Ingresses</td></tr>
                            </tbody>
