                    <details><summary>Show Answer</summary>
                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <p>No — the plugin is strictly read-only (<code>get</code>/<code>list</code>/<code>watch</code>). It cannot create, update, scale, or delete any K8s resource.</p>
