  input:
    repoContentsUrl: ${{ steps.publish.output.repoContentsUrl }}</code></pre></div>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>Under the Hood §① — this is the output-chaining mechanism that lets steps compose without knowing about each other.</p></div>
