                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <div class="code-block-wrapper"><div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">validate before running</span></div><pre><code class="language-bash">yarn backstage-cli repo schema openapi validate ./template.yaml</code></pre></div>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>Catches missing apiVersion, wrong kind, missing parameters/steps, and YAML syntax errors — run it as a pre-commit check since a broken template affects everyone.</p></div>
                    </details>
