                    <span class="eq-number">Q5</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">What's the difference between fetch:template and fetch:plain?</div>
                    <details><summary>Show Answer</summary>
                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Action</th><th>Copies</th><th>Replaces placeholders?</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr><td><code>fetch:template</code></td><td>Local skeleton files</td><td>✅ Yes</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><code>fetch:plain</code></td><td>Files from a URL</td><td>❌ No</td></tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>If you need customization per project (different names, owners, ports), you MUST use fetch:template.</p></div>
                    </details>
