                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <div class="code-block-wrapper"><div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">reading a previous step's output</span></div><pre><code class="language-yaml">${{ steps.publish.output.repoContentsUrl }}</code></pre></div>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>Each action declares what outputs it produces; subsequent steps reference these via <code>${{ steps.id.output.name }}</code>.</p></div>
