                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <p>The GitHub token is missing, expired, or lacks permissions.</p>
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Check</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr><td>1</td><td>Is <code>${GITHUB_TOKEN}</code> set?</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>2</td><td>Does the token have <code>repo</code> + <code>workflow</code> scopes?</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>3</td><td>Is it configured in <code>integrations.github</code>?</td></tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>401 = Unauthorized, almost always a token issue — check env var, scopes, then config.</p></div>
                    </details>
