                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q8</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">Where should custom template actions be registered in the backend?</div>
                    <details><summary>Show Answer</summary>
                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <p>In <code>packages/backend/src/plugins/scaffolder.ts</code>.</p>
                        <div class="code-block-wrapper"><div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">registering the action</span></div><pre><code class="language-typescript">scaffolderActions.push(createNotifySlackAction());</code></pre></div>
