            <!-- ─────────── §13.2 ─────────── -->
            <section class="section-block" id="b-s13-2">
                <h3 class="section-h">13.2 Template: New React Frontend</h3>
                <div class="card-grid cols-2">
                    <div class="info-card highlight"><h5>⚛️ What It Scaffolds</h5><p>React app with <strong>Vite + Material UI</strong>. Pre-configured CI/CD. catalog-info.yaml, multi-stage Dockerfile (Node build → Nginx serve), GH Actions workflow, K8s manifests, TechDocs skeleton.</p></div>
