                <h3 class="section-h">14.7 TechDocs Addon Framework — Extending the Reading Experience</h3>
                <p>The <strong>TechDocs Addon Framework</strong> (introduced in Backstage 1.2) lets you augment TechDocs pages at read-time. Addons are React components that render alongside documentation — think report-issue buttons, feedback widgets, or custom headers.</p>

