                    <strong>Backend:</strong> <code>@backstage/plugin-techdocs-backend</code><br>
                    <strong>CLI (local dev):</strong> <code>@techdocs/cli</code><br>
                    <strong>Docker (generation):</strong> <code>techdocs-container</code></p>
                </div>
