            <section class="section-block" id="b-s17-2">
                <h3 class="section-h">17.2 CI/CD Plugins — Build &amp; Deploy Visibility</h3>
                <div class="comparison-table">
                    <table>
                        <thead><tr><th>Plugin</th><th>Annotation</th><th>What It Shows</th><th>Proxy Required?</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr id="b-s17-2a"><td><strong>Jenkins</strong></td><td><code>jenkins.io/job-full-name</code></td><td>Build history, trigger jobs, test results</td><td>✅ Yes</td></tr>
                            <tr id="b-s17-2b"><td><strong>GitHub Actions</strong></td><td><code>github.com/project-slug</code></td><td>Workflow runs, status, logs, duration</td><td>❌ (uses integration)</td></tr>
                            <tr id="b-s17-2c"><td><strong>ArgoCD</strong></td><td><code>argocd/app-name</code></td><td>GitOps sync status, health, history</td><td>✅ Yes</td></tr>
                            <tr id="b-s17-2d"><td><strong>GitLab CI</strong></td><td><code>gitlab.com/project-id</code></td><td>Pipeline status, MR overview, job logs</td><td>✅ Yes</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
                <div class="diagram-container">
                    <div class="diagram-title">CI/CD Plugin Configuration — GitHub Actions + ArgoCD</div>
<pre><code class="language-yaml"># Annotations enable each CI/CD plugin's card:
metadata:
  annotations:
    github.com/project-slug: easypj/jobpost      <span class="comment"># GitHub Actions card</span>
    jenkins.io/job-full-name: easypj/jobpost-build <span class="comment"># Jenkins card</span>
    argocd/app-name: jobpost                        <span class="comment"># ArgoCD card</span>

# app-config.yaml — ArgoCD backend needs its API endpoint
argocd:
  baseUrl: https://argocd.easypj.com</code></pre>
                </div>
                <div class="info-box tip mb-0"><h5>💡 CBA Tip — Proxy Pattern for CI/CD</h5><p class="mb-0">ALL CI/CD plugins except GitHub Actions use the Backstage proxy. Configure <code>proxy.endpoints</code> in app-config.yaml with the CI/CD tool's URL and auth token. The frontend calls <code>/api/proxy/...</code>, Backstage injects the token server-side, and forwards the request. Token NEVER reaches the browser.</p></div>
            </section>

