                    <div class="info-card highlight" id="b-s17-3a"><h5>📊 Grafana</h5><p>Embeds dashboards via iframes. Configure dashboard URLs per service. Each entity gets its own metrics view.</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card" id="b-s17-3b"><h5>🚨 Prometheus</h5><p>Shows alert status and firing alerts. Links entities to Prometheus alert rules via annotation.</p></div>
