                    <li><strong><code>curl https://backstage.easypj.com/healthcheck</code></strong> is the fastest end-to-end proof the Ingress, Service and Pods are all wired correctly.</li>
                    <li><strong>Prefer <code>helm upgrade</code> over deleting and reinstalling</strong> — it preserves your customized values.yaml and gives you <code>helm rollback</code> for free.</li>
