                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q9</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">You have 3 Backstage pods but only one shows TechDocs. What's wrong?</div>
                    <details><summary>Show Answer</summary>
                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <p>You're using the <strong>local TechDocs publisher</strong>. Each pod has its own <code>./techdocs-output/</code> directory. Fix: switch to cloud storage (GCS/S3/Azure), or use <code>builder: external</code> to pre-build docs in CI/CD.</p>
