                            <tr><td>get / list / watch</td><td>✅ Yes</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>create / update / delete</td><td>❌ Never</td></tr>
                        </tbody></table>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>A ClusterRole (not Role) is needed because it needs cluster-wide access to discover resources across namespaces. CBA: know the 3 read verbs and that ClusterRoleBinding is required.</p></div>
