annotation value (entity)  ==  label value (Deployment)   →  match, resources shown
annotation value (entity)  ==  Deployment NAME             →  NOT how it works
                        </pre>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>3 annotation methods: kubernetes-id (label match — most common), kubernetes-namespace (override namespace), kubernetes-label-selector (label query). CBA: kubernetes-id must match a LABEL, case-sensitive.</p></div>
