                    <li><strong>isEntityOwner is the single most common real-world rule</strong> — "you can edit what you own" — reach for it first.</li>
                    <li><strong>Use the curl authorize command from §23.5</strong> to isolate a policy bug before blaming the UI or the catalog plugin.</li>
