                            <tr><td>hasLabel</td><td>Entity has a specific label</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>hasSpec</td><td>Entity has a specific spec field</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>hasMetadata</td><td>Entity has a specific metadata field</td></tr>
                        </tbody></table>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>6 built-in conditions total (catalogConditions.*). Composable with AND/OR.</p></div>
                    </details>
