                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <p><code>catalogEntityReadPermission</code> controls who can VIEW entities. Usually granted to everyone.<br><code>catalogEntityDeletePermission</code> controls who can DELETE entities. Usually restricted to owners or admins via a CONDITIONAL decision.</p>
