                        <div class="code-block-wrapper"><div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">the shape</span></div><pre><code class="language-typescript">// packages/backend/src/extensions/permissionsPolicyExtension.ts
