                        <p>Whether a non-admin, non-owner user is correctly DENIED, and whether the actual entity owner is correctly ALLOWED — testing only as admin (who typically has broad access anyway) doesn't verify the CONDITIONAL/owner-scoping logic actually works for the users it's meant to restrict.</p>
                        <table><thead><tr><th>Tested as</th><th>Verifies owner-scoping?</th></tr></thead><tbody>
