                        <div class="info-card highlight"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔑</div><h5>Token Scopes Required</h5><p>GitHub personal access token needs <code>repo</code> scope (private repos) or <code>public_repo</code> (public). For workflow runs specifically: <code>actions:read</code>. Set as <code>GITHUB_TOKEN</code> env var referenced in app-config.yaml.</p></div>
