                <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                    <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">catalog-info.yaml + app-config.yaml — reusing the Ch21 argocd block</span></div>
<pre><code class="language-yaml"># catalog-info.yaml — Entity linked to ArgoCD application
