                </div>

                <div class="card-grid cols-2">
                    <div class="info-card highlight"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔄</div><h5>ArgoCD Plugin</h5><p>Annotation: <code>argocd/app-name</code>. Shows sync status (🟢 Synced / 🟡 OutOfSync), health (🏥 Healthy / 🟡 Degraded), deployment history timeline, and revision info. Also provides a "Sync" button to trigger sync from Backstage.</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">⚡</div><h5>Flux Plugin</h5><p>Annotation: <code>fluxcd.io/namespace</code> + <code>fluxcd.io/name</code>. Shows Kustomization/HelmRelease status, reconciliation state, and dependents. Flux-native GitOps visibility in Backstage.</p></div>
