                    <li><strong>Forgetting the entity annotation</strong> — the plugin has NOTHING to discover without github.com/project-slug (or the equivalent) on that specific entity.</li>
                    <li><strong>Assuming a first-party @backstage/plugin-gitlab exists</strong> — it does not; using the wrong package name silently fails install (§25.4).</li>
                    <li><strong>Re-configuring ArgoCD twice</strong> (once for Chapter 21 GitOps, again here) instead of reusing the one argocd config block for both (§25.5).</li>
