                <h3 class="section-h">27.2 Logging — Structured JSON Logging</h3>
                <div class="card-grid cols-2">
                    <div class="info-card highlight"><h5>📝 Structured JSON Logging</h5><p>Backstage's backend writes structured JSON logs. All logs are output as JSON, making them easy to parse, ship, and query.</p></div>
