            <section class="section-block" id="b-s27-3">
                <h3 class="section-h">27.3 Alerting — What to Monitor &amp; Where to Route</h3>
                <div class="comparison-table">
                    <table class="comparison-table">
                        <thead><tr><th>Alert</th><th>Threshold</th><th>Route To</th><th>Priority</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr><td><strong>Backstage is down</strong></td><td>&gt;1 minute</td><td>🔴 PagerDuty</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>Error rate spike</strong></td><td>&gt;1-5% of requests</td><td>🔴 PagerDuty</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>Catalog ingestion stalled</strong></td><td>Failed &gt;5 min</td><td>🔴 PagerDuty</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>DB connection failure</strong></td><td>Any occurrence</td><td>🔴 PagerDuty</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>Certificate expiring</strong></td><td>&lt;30 days</td><td>🟡 Slack</td><td>Warning</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>Disk space high</strong></td><td>&gt;80%</td><td>🟡 Slack</td><td>Warning</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>High latency</strong></td><td>p95 &gt; 500ms</td><td>🟡 Slack</td><td>Warning</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                    <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">alertmanager-rules.yaml — the real rule</span></div>
<pre><code class="language-yaml">groups:
  - name: backstage
    rules:
      - alert: BackstageDown
        expr: up{job='backstage'} == 0
        for: 2m
        labels: { severity: critical }
        annotations: { summary: 'Backstage is down' }</code></pre>
                </div>

                <div class="info-box warning mb-0"><h5>⚠️ CBA Exam Note — Alert Routing</h5><p class="mb-0">Critical = PagerDuty (wakes someone up). Warning = Slack (can wait until morning). The CBA may ask: "An alert fires for 85% disk usage — where should it go?" Answer: Slack (warning threshold, not critical). Also expect a "stalled catalog ingestion" alert to be tested as critical, not just HTTP-error-based alerts.</p></div>
            </section>

