                    <li><strong>Looking for Prometheus metrics under /api/metrics</strong> and missing the OpenTelemetry endpoint on :9464 that current docs point to (§27.1).</li>
                    <li><strong>Confusing readiness with liveness</strong> — they answer different questions ("can it take traffic" vs "is it alive at all") (§27.1).</li>
                    <li><strong>Treating monitoring (is it up) and analytics (is it used) as the same thing</strong> — you need both, for different reasons (§27.4).</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

