                <p><strong>HA Checklist:</strong> Multi-AZ K8s cluster (≥3 zones), PostgreSQL with streaming replication + automatic failover (Patroni/PgBouncer), cloud storage with cross-region replication for TechDocs, load balancer with health checks on the real <code>/.backstage/health/v1/readiness</code> route (Chapter 27's corrected default, or your own registered custom route). <strong>DR Plan:</strong> Git contains all config (GitOps) — redeploy in new region in &lt;30 min. Nightly PostgreSQL snapshot + a tested restore drill, retain 30 days.</p>
