                    <li><strong>Assuming session state can live in pod memory</strong> — it can't, if you want replicas to be interchangeable (§29.2).</li>
                    <li><strong>Confusing simple horizontal scaling with the advanced "service separation" lever,</strong> which needs a custom DiscoveryService and is a much bigger change (§29.2).</li>
