                    <tr><td>25</td><td>You need to model a PostgreSQL database that jobpost depends on. Which entity kind is correct? A) Component B) Resource C) System D) API</td><td><strong>B</strong></td><td>Resource represents infrastructure you USE, not software you build — Component would be the wrong choice here.</td></tr>
