                    <tr><td>27</td><td>What is the key difference between a manual Location and an automated ingestion Provider? A) They are the same thing with different names B) A Location points to ONE known file; a Provider discovers MANY entities on a recurring schedule C) Providers only work with GitLab D) Locations require a paid Backstage license</td><td><strong>B</strong></td><td>Manual Locations don't scale past a handful of repos; automated Providers (e.g. GitHub org discovery) scan an entire org on a schedule.</td></tr>
