                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <p>An <strong>EntityProvider</strong> introduces entities into the catalog from an external system with no static YAML (via <code>connect()</code>/<code>applyMutation()</code>). A <strong>CatalogProcessor</strong> enriches entities that are already there (via <code>postProcessEntity()</code>).</p>
