                            <tr><td>EntityProvider</td><td><code>getProviderName()</code>, <code>connect()</code>, <code>applyMutation()</code></td></tr>
                            <tr><td>CatalogProcessor</td><td><code>getProcessorName()</code>, <code>postProcessEntity()</code></td></tr>
                        </tbody></table>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>§32.1's info box — pick the extension point by whether you're introducing or enriching.</p></div>
