            <div class="info-box note"><h5>🔑 Understanding Entity Relationships</h5><p class="mb-0"><strong>Domain → System → Component:</strong> Top-down hierarchy. A Domain (like "Recruitment") contains Systems (like "easypj-platform"), which contain Components (like "jobpost"). <strong>Component → API:</strong> Components <code>providesApis</code> to declare what APIs they expose. <strong>Component → Resource:</strong> Components <code>dependsOn</code> Resources to declare infrastructure dependencies. <strong>Group → User:</strong> Groups have members (Users). Groups <code>own</code> entities. <strong>Template &amp; Location:</strong> Meta-entities — Templates define scaffolding recipes, Locations point to where entity YAML files live.</p></div>

            <section class="section-block" id="sb-1">
                <h3 class="section-h">B.1 Component Template</h3>
                <p>The most common entity — represents software <strong>you build</strong> (services, websites, libraries, CLIs).</p>
                <div class="card-grid cols-4">
                    <div class="info-card highlight"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔧</div><h5>Component</h5><p>Software you BUILD. Types: service, website, library, CLI. Example: jobpost Django app.</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔌</div><h5>API</h5><p>API definitions. Types: openapi, asyncapi, graphql, grpc. Example: jobpost REST API.</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">📦</div><h5>System</h5><p>Groups Components+APIs. Example: easypj-platform (contains jobpost + jobpost-api).</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🌐</div><h5>Domain</h5><p>Business area grouping Systems. Example: Recruitment (contains easypj-platform).</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🗄️</div><h5>Resource</h5><p>Infrastructure you USE. Types: database, s3-bucket, cache, pubsub-topic. Example: PostgreSQL DB.</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">👤</div><h5>User/Group</h5><p>People &amp; teams. Auto-discovered via auth. Groups own entities. Users are members of Groups.</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">📋</div><h5>Template</h5><p>Scaffolder blueprints. Define what gets created when someone clicks "Create".</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">📍</div><h5>Location</h5><p>Points to where entity YAML files live (URLs/files). Tells Backstage where to ingest from.</p></div>
                </div>
