            <section class="section-block" id="sh-1">
                <h3 class="section-h">H.1 Key YAML Structures — Minimum Requirements</h3>
                <div class="info-box note"><h5>📋 These 4 fields are REQUIRED in every catalog-info.yaml</h5><p class="mb-0">Without ANY of these 4, the entity will fail to register. The CBA WILL test this.</p></div>
                <div class="comparison-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Value</th><th>Required?</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><code>apiVersion</code></td><td><code>backstage.io/v1alpha1</code></td><td>✅ Required</td><td><code>apiVersion: backstage.io/v1alpha1</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>kind</code></td><td>One of 9 kinds</td><td>✅ Required</td><td><code>kind: Component</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>metadata</code></td><td>At minimum: <code>name</code></td><td>✅ Required</td><td><code>metadata: { name: jobpost }</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>spec</code></td><td>Kind-specific</td><td>✅ Required</td><td><code>spec: { type: service, lifecycle: production, owner: team }</code></td></tr>
                </tbody></table></div>
                <div class="info-box note"><h5>📋 These fields are REQUIRED in every template.yaml</h5></div>
                <div class="comparison-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Value</th><th>Required?</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><code>apiVersion</code></td><td><code>scaffolder.backstage.io/v1beta3</code></td><td>✅ Required</td><td><code>apiVersion: scaffolder.backstage.io/v1beta3</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>kind</code></td><td><code>Template</code></td><td>✅ Required</td><td><code>kind: Template</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>metadata</code></td><td>name, title, description, tags</td><td>✅ Required</td><td><code>metadata: { name: django-svc, title: "Django Service" }</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>spec</code></td><td>owner, type, parameters, steps</td><td>✅ Required</td><td><code>spec: { owner: team, type: service, parameters: [...], steps: [...] }</code></td></tr>
                </tbody></table></div>
                <div class="cka-exam-tip"><h5>🎯 CBA Exam Tip</h5><p class="mb-0">The most common exam trick: showing a catalog-info.yaml missing <code>apiVersion</code> or <code>kind</code> and asking "Will this register successfully?" Answer: NO. Without these 4 fields, the entity YAML is invalid. Also: <code>apiVersion: backstage.io/v1alpha1</code> (NOT v1 or v1alpha2) and <code>scaffolder.backstage.io/v1beta3</code> (NOT v1beta2).</p></div>
