            <section class="section-block" id="sh-2">
                <h3 class="section-h">H.2 Entity Kinds — Complete Reference</h3>
                <p>Memorize all 9 entity kinds. The CBA will ask "You're modeling X — which entity kind?" for every scenario.</p>
                <div class="comparison-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Kind</th><th>Use For</th><th>spec.type Examples</th><th>CBA Scenario</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><strong>Component</strong></td><td>Software YOU build</td><td>service, website, library, CLI</td><td>"You're deploying a microservice..."</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>API</strong></td><td>API definitions</td><td>openapi, asyncapi, graphql, grpc</td><td>"You have a REST API spec..."</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>System</strong></td><td>Group of Components+Resources</td><td>(product/application name)</td><td>"Group 5 microservices into one product..."</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Domain</strong></td><td>Business area (contains Systems)</td><td>(HR, Finance, Engineering)</td><td>"Group all HR-related Systems..."</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Resource</strong></td><td>Infrastructure you USE</td><td>database, s3-bucket, cache, pubsub-topic</td><td>"You have a PostgreSQL database..."</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>User</strong></td><td>A person</td><td>(auto-discovered via auth)</td><td>"Model an employee..."</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Group</strong></td><td>A team/squad/tribe</td><td>team, squad, tribe</td><td>"Model the platform engineering team..."</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Template</strong></td><td>Scaffolder blueprint</td><td>service, website</td><td>"Create a scaffolding recipe..."</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Location</strong></td><td>Where entity YAML files live</td><td>url, file</td><td>"Register a GitHub org as a source..."</td></tr>
                </tbody></table></div>
                <div class="card-grid cols-2">
                    <div class="info-card highlight"><div class="card-icon-lg">⚠️</div><h5>Common CBA Trap</h5><p>"You have a database — create a Component?" <strong>WRONG.</strong> A database is infrastructure you USE → <strong>Resource</strong> (type: database). Components are things you BUILD.</p></div>
                    <div class="info-card"><div class="card-icon-lg">🔑</div><h5>Entity Hierarchy</h5><p>Domain → System → Component. A Domain contains Systems. A System contains Components and Resources. Components provide APIs. Groups own everything. Users belong to Groups.</p></div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="section-block" id="sh-3">
                <h3 class="section-h">H.3 Annotations — Quick Reference</h3>
                <p>Annotations are the "glue" that connect entities to external tools. The CBA frequently tests which annotation links to which tool.</p>
                <div class="comparison-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Annotation</th><th>Links To</th><th>Plugin</th><th>Example Value</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><code>github.com/project-slug</code></td><td>GitHub repository</td><td>GitHub Integration</td><td><code>easypj/jobpost</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>backstage.io/techdocs-ref</code></td><td>Documentation location</td><td>TechDocs</td><td><code>dir:.</code> or <code>url:https://...</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>backstage.io/kubernetes-id</code></td><td>K8s Deployment name</td><td>Kubernetes</td><td><code>jobpost</code> (must match exactly)</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>backstage.io/kubernetes-namespace</code></td><td>K8s namespace</td><td>Kubernetes</td><td><code>production</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>jenkins.io/job-full-name</code></td><td>Jenkins job</td><td>Jenkins</td><td><code>easypj/jobpost-build</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>pagerduty.com/service-id</code></td><td>PagerDuty service</td><td>PagerDuty</td><td><code>P12345</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>sentry.io/project-slug</code></td><td>Sentry project</td><td>Sentry</td><td><code>easypj/jobpost</code></td></tr>
